#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/colord.xml:109
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Colord"
msgstr "Instalação do \"Colord\""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/colord.xml:112
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"There should be a dedicated user and group to take control of the colord "
"daemon after it has started. Issue the following commands as the <systemitem"
" class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Deveria existir um(a) usuário(a) e um grupo dedicados para assumir o "
"controle do processo de segundo plano \"colord\" após ele ser iniciado. "
"Emita os seguintes comandos como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/colord.xml:117
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>groupadd -g 71 colord &amp;&amp;\n"
"useradd -c \"Color Daemon Owner\" -d /var/lib/colord -u 71 \\\n"
"        -g colord -s /bin/false colord</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>groupadd -g 71 colord &amp;&amp;\n"
"useradd -c \"Proprietário(a) do Processo de Segundo Plano de Cores\" -d /var/lib/colord -u 71 \\\n"
"        -g colord -s /bin/false colord</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/colord.xml:122
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>Colord</application> by running the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale <application>Colord</application> executando os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/colord.xml:126
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup ..                 \\\n"
"      --prefix=/usr            \\\n"
"      --buildtype=release      \\\n"
"      -Ddaemon_user=colord     \\\n"
"      -Dvapi=true              \\\n"
"      -Dsystemd=false          \\\n"
"      -Dlibcolordcompat=true   \\\n"
"      -Dargyllcms_sensor=false \\\n"
"      -Dbash_completion=false  \\\n"
"      -Ddocs=false             \\\n"
"      -Dman=false              &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup ..                 \\\n"
"      --prefix=/usr            \\\n"
"      --buildtype=release      \\\n"
"      -Ddaemon_user=colord     \\\n"
"      -Dvapi=true              \\\n"
"      -Dsystemd=false          \\\n"
"      -Dlibcolordcompat=true   \\\n"
"      -Dargyllcms_sensor=false \\\n"
"      -Dbash_completion=false  \\\n"
"      -Ddocs=false             \\\n"
"      -Dman=false              &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/colord.xml:142
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup ..                 \\\n"
"      --prefix=/usr            \\\n"
"      --buildtype=release      \\\n"
"      -Ddaemon_user=colord     \\\n"
"      -Dvapi=true              \\\n"
"      -Dsystemd=true           \\\n"
"      -Dlibcolordcompat=true   \\\n"
"      -Dargyllcms_sensor=false \\\n"
"      -Dbash_completion=false  \\\n"
"      -Ddocs=false             \\\n"
"      -Dman=false              &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup ..                 \\\n"
"      --prefix=/usr            \\\n"
"      --buildtype=release      \\\n"
"      -Ddaemon_user=colord     \\\n"
"      -Dvapi=true              \\\n"
"      -Dsystemd=true           \\\n"
"      -Dlibcolordcompat=true   \\\n"
"      -Dargyllcms_sensor=false \\\n"
"      -Dbash_completion=false  \\\n"
"      -Ddocs=false             \\\n"
"      -Dman=false              &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/colord.xml:159
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/colord.xml:162
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/colord.xml:165
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To test the results, issue: <command>ninja test</command>.  One test, "
"<filename>colord-self-test-daemon</filename>, will fail if the package is "
"already installed. The test suite must be run with the system-wide D-Bus "
"Daemon running."
msgstr ""
"Para testar os resultados, emita: <command>ninja test</command>. Um teste, "
"<filename>colord-self-test-daemon</filename>, falhará se o pacote já estiver"
" instalado. A suíte de teste precisa ser executada com o \"D-Bus Daemon\" "
"abrangente ao sistema em execução."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/colord.xml:174
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/colord.xml:180
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-Ddaemon_user=colord</parameter>: This switch is used so the "
"colord daemon will run as an unprivileged user instead of the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-Ddaemon_user=colord</parameter>: Essa chave é usada de modo que "
"o processo de segundo plano \"colord\" executará como um(a) usuário(a) sem "
"privilégios em vez do(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/colord.xml:186
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-Dvapi=true</parameter>: This switch enables building the "
"<application>Vala</application> bindings. Remove if you don't have <xref "
"linkend=\"vala\"/> installed."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-Dvapi=true</parameter>: Essa chave habilita construir as "
"ligações <application>Vala</application>. Remova se você não tiver <xref "
"linkend=\"vala\"/> instalado."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/colord.xml:192
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-Dsystemd=false</parameter>: This switch disables support for "
"<application>systemd</application> login in Colord applications."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-Dsystemd=false</parameter>: Essa chave desabilita o suporte para"
" login <application>systemd</application> em aplicativos \"Colord\"."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/colord.xml:198
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-Dsystemd=true</parameter>: This switch enables installation of "
"the <application>systemd</application> service."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-Dsystemd=true</parameter>: Essa chave habilita a instalação do "
"serviço <application>systemd</application>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/colord.xml:203
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-Dlibcolordcompat=true</parameter>: This switch enables building "
"a compatibility library for older packages that use "
"<application>Colord</application>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-Dlibcolordcompat=true</parameter>: Essa chave habilita construir"
" uma biblioteca de compatibilidade para pacotes mais antigos que usam "
"<application>Colord</application>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/colord.xml:209
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-Dargyllcms_sensor=false</parameter>: This switch disables the "
"ArgLLCMS sensor driver. Omit if you have <ulink "
"url=\"https://www.argyllcms.com/\">ArgyllCMS</ulink> installed and wish to "
"use it."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-Dargyllcms_sensor=false</parameter>: Essa chave desabilita o "
"controlador do sensor \"ArgLLCMS\". Omita se você tiver <ulink "
"url=\"https://www.argyllcms.com/\">ArgyllCMS</ulink> instalado e desejar "
"usá-lo."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/colord.xml:216
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-Dbash_completion=false</parameter>: This switch disables Bash "
"Completion support for Colord applications."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-Dbash_completion=false</parameter>: Essa chave desabilita o "
"suporte ao \"Bash Completion\" para aplicativos \"Colord\"."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/colord.xml:221
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-Ddocs=false</parameter>: This switch disables building of "
"documentation. Omit if you have <xref linkend=\"gtk-doc\"/> available."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-Ddocs=false</parameter>: Essa chave desabilita a construção de "
"documentação. Omita se você tiver <xref linkend=\"gtk-doc\"/> disponível."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/colord.xml:226
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-Dman=false</parameter>: This switch disables building of man "
"pages. Omit if you have <xref linkend=\"docbook-utils\"/> available. "
"Namespaced versions of the docbook-xsl stylesheets are also required."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-Dman=false</parameter>: Essa chave desabilita a construção de "
"páginas de manual. Omita se você tiver <xref linkend=\"docbook-utils\"/> "
"disponível. Versões de espaço de nomes das folhas de estilo \"docbook-xsl\" "
"também são necessárias."

